WEBVTT

00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:06.062
Come on. It's here.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:07.193
Come on, Beaky!

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:08.542
DUMBLEDORE:
Here we are, Minister.

00:00:08.586 --> 00:00:09.630
Follow me.

00:00:09.674 --> 00:00:11.067
Now, look there, you see?Where?

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.895
Look, beyond the rocks.[ Hermione gasps]

00:00:12.938 --> 00:00:13.896
What am I supposed
to see?

00:00:13.939 --> 00:00:15.854
DUMBLEDORE:
Professor Dippet

00:00:15.898 --> 00:00:18.465
had that ling planted
when he was Headmaster.

00:00:18.509 --> 00:00:19.771
Oh, yes.
Indeed, indeed.

00:00:19.815 --> 00:00:21.512
And all the
strawberries you see.

00:00:21.555 --> 00:00:23.166
Strawberries?Come on, Buckbeak.

00:00:23.209 --> 00:00:24.297
I see
no strawberries.

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:25.864
Come on.Over there.

00:00:25.908 --> 00:00:26.996
Come on.Where?

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:27.997
See over there? Look again.Oh, yes.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.302
HARRY:
This way.

00:00:29.346 --> 00:00:30.738
FUDGE:
Well, let's get this
over please.

00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:33.176
All right.

00:00:33.219 --> 00:00:34.960
But where is it?

00:00:35.004 --> 00:00:38.355
I saw the beast, just now.

00:00:38.398 --> 00:00:39.399
Not a moment ago.

00:00:39.443 --> 00:00:40.792
DUMBLEDORE:
How extraordinary.

00:00:40.836 --> 00:00:42.359
[ whispers]:
Buckbeak.

00:00:42.402 --> 00:00:43.708
FUDGE:
Oh, come now, Dumbledore.

00:00:43.751 --> 00:00:45.841
Someone's obviously
released him. Hagrid?

00:00:45.884 --> 00:00:47.190
[ Hermione gasps]:
Buckbeak.

00:00:47.233 --> 00:00:48.756
Professor, I swear I didn't.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:50.236
DUMBLEDORE:
I don't think the Minister's

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.890
suggesting that you
had anything

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:52.848
to do with this, Hagrid.

00:00:52.891 --> 00:00:53.892
After all, how could you?

00:00:53.936 --> 00:00:55.285
You've been with
us all the time.

00:00:55.328 --> 00:00:56.764
HAGRID:
Well, right.

00:00:56.808 --> 00:00:57.722
Well... well...

00:00:57.765 --> 00:00:59.202
We must search the grounds.

00:00:59.245 --> 00:01:02.553
Oh, search the skies,
if you must, Minister.

00:01:02.596 --> 00:01:06.122
Meanwhile, I'd like
a nice cup of tea

00:01:06.165 --> 00:01:07.906
or a large brandy.Right.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:11.997
Oh, Executioner, your services
are no longer required.

00:01:12.041 --> 00:01:13.390
Thank you.

00:01:13.433 --> 00:01:15.174
Huh!

00:01:15.218 --> 00:01:18.047
HAGRID:
You'll find no small glasses
in this house, Professor.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:21.398
[ birds squawking]

00:01:21.964 --> 00:01:25.054
[ distressed cawing]

00:01:27.143 --> 00:01:29.232
[ panting]:
Okay, Beaky, this way!

00:01:29.275 --> 00:01:30.711
Come on!
This way! Okay.

00:01:30.755 --> 00:01:31.799
This way.

00:01:31.843 --> 00:01:32.844
[ panting]

00:01:32.888 --> 00:01:34.280
[ whispering]:
Come on!

00:01:34.324 --> 00:01:35.934
Come on, this way!

00:01:35.978 --> 00:01:37.457
This way, now.

00:01:37.501 --> 00:01:39.068
[ bleating]

00:01:39.111 --> 00:01:40.286
Come on.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:41.897
[ panting]:
Now what?

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:43.159
We save Sirius.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:44.203
How?!

00:01:44.247 --> 00:01:45.117
No idea.

00:01:45.161 --> 00:01:47.293
[ Buckbeak belches]

00:01:48.599 --> 00:01:51.863
[ panting]

00:01:53.996 --> 00:01:56.302
HERMOINE:
Look. It's Lupin!

00:01:56.346 --> 00:01:59.610
Immobulus!

00:02:02.395 --> 00:02:03.657
[ creaking]

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:05.964
And Snape's
coming.

00:02:06.008 --> 00:02:08.575
[ panting]

00:02:11.361 --> 00:02:14.973
And now we wait.

00:02:15.017 --> 00:02:17.280
And now we wait.

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:29.161
[ chirping]

00:02:35.037 --> 00:02:36.516
[ crunching]

00:02:38.214 --> 00:02:39.215
[ grunts]

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:42.522
[ chirping continues]

00:02:43.088 --> 00:02:44.611
HERMIONE:
At least someone's

00:02:44.655 --> 00:02:45.612
enjoying himself.

00:02:45.656 --> 00:02:47.223
HARRY:
Yeah.

00:02:50.226 --> 00:02:51.488
Hermione?

00:02:51.531 --> 00:02:52.663
Yeah?

00:02:52.706 --> 00:02:54.447
Before... down
by the lake,

00:02:54.491 --> 00:02:56.319
when I was
with Sirius...

00:02:56.362 --> 00:02:58.495
I did see someone.

00:02:58.538 --> 00:03:02.194
That someone made
the dementors go away.

00:03:02.238 --> 00:03:03.761
With a Patronus.

00:03:03.804 --> 00:03:06.024
I heard Snape
telling Dumbledore.

00:03:06.068 --> 00:03:07.547
According to him,

00:03:07.591 --> 00:03:11.464
only a really powerful wizard
could have conjured it.

00:03:11.508 --> 00:03:12.900
It was my dad.

00:03:12.944 --> 00:03:15.294
It was my dad who
conjured the Patronus.

00:03:15.338 --> 00:03:17.079
But Harry,
your-your dad's...

00:03:17.122 --> 00:03:19.342
Dead. I know!

00:03:19.385 --> 00:03:22.823
I'm just telling
you what I saw.

00:03:25.913 --> 00:03:28.003
Here we come.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.879
HARRY:
You see Sirius
talking to me there?

00:03:34.922 --> 00:03:36.272
HERMOINE:
Mm-hmm.

00:03:36.315 --> 00:03:37.795
He's asking me to come
and live with him.

00:03:37.838 --> 00:03:39.188
HERMIONE:
That's great.

00:03:39.231 --> 00:03:40.798
When we free him,
I'll never have to go

00:03:40.841 --> 00:03:42.495
back to the Dursley's.
It'll just be me and him.

00:03:42.539 --> 00:03:44.541
[ Peter Pettigrew
speaks indistinctly]

00:03:44.584 --> 00:03:46.456
We could live
in the country,

00:03:46.499 --> 00:03:48.327
someplace you
can see the sky.

00:03:48.371 --> 00:03:49.720
I think he'll
like that,

00:03:49.763 --> 00:03:51.504
after all those
years in Azkaban.

00:03:51.548 --> 00:03:54.072
[ Professor Lupin
speaks indistinctly]

00:03:54.116 --> 00:03:56.248
HERMIONE:
Harry!

00:03:57.162 --> 00:03:58.381
SIRIUS:
Run!

00:03:58.424 --> 00:03:59.556
Run!

00:03:59.599 --> 00:04:02.080
[ snarls, Hermione screams]

00:04:02.124 --> 00:04:05.214
[ roars, barking]

00:04:05.257 --> 00:04:07.564
Let's go.

00:04:08.043 --> 00:04:09.740
[ yelping]

00:04:09.783 --> 00:04:13.744
[ snarling and barking]

